---
description: Keep the dashboard footer aligned with each building-in-public day commit.
alwaysApply: true
---

Before committing work for Day N, update the `.app-footer` in `index.html`
with that Day number and its date, including month, day of month and year.
Use the date specified by the user, otherwise the current Europe/Rome date.
Keep the existing English format, for example:
`v1.0 · Day 50 · October 28, 2026`.
Verify the footer matches the Day and date in the README challenge log.
Include the footer update in the same commit as the day's changes.
